                <mxCell id="12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;Domain / Core:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;This is the heart of the system. It contains pure C# domain logic with no external &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;libraries &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;or framework dependencies.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Oxygen Sans&amp;quot;, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;This layer defines what the system &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot; data-start=&quot;321&quot;&gt;does&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;. It contains use cases, application &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;services, and &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;orchestration logic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Oxygen Sans&amp;quot;, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Oxygen Sans&amp;quot;, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;This is where technical details live. It implements abstractions defined in the core and &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;integrates with external systems such as databases, email services, file storage, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Oxygen Sans&amp;quot;, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Presentation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-align: center; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;This is the entry point to the system. It includes controllers, endpoints, APIs, and other &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;delivery mechanisms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Oxygen Sans&amp;quot;, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
